==Finnish==
{{Finnish index|p|e}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*petra}}. Cognates include dialectal {{cog|fi|petra}}, {{cog|et|põder}}, {{cog|vep|pedr}} and {{cog|vot|põdra}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# a [[reindeer]] or a [[caribou]], a general term used to refer to the deer species ''{{l|mul|Rangifer tarandus}}'' and its twelve subspecies
# {{short for|fi|metsäpeura||Finnish forest reindeer (''Rangifer tarandus fennicus'')}}
# [[telemetacarpal deer]] {{gloss|any species of subfamily {{l|mul|Capreolinae}}}}
# any medium-sized [[deer]] of unspecified species

